{"text":"kuruntokai","n":75,"lines":["நீகண் டனையோ கண்டார்க் கேட்டனையோ","ஒன்று தௌிய நசையினம் மொழிமோ","வெண்கோட் டியானை சோணை படியும்","பொன்மலி பாடலி பெறீஇயர்","யார்வாய்க் கேட்டனை காதலர் வரவே"],"tr":["nīkaṇ ṭaṉaiyō kaṇṭārk kēṭṭaṉaiyō","oṉṟu tauya nacaiyiṉam moḻimō","veṇkōṭ ṭiyāṉai cōṇai paṭiyum","poṉmali pāṭali peṟīiyar","yārvāyk kēṭṭaṉai kātalar varavē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"marutam","tinai_ta":"மருதம்","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"படுமரத்து மோசிகீரனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Paṭumarattu Mōcikīraṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 18, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 10, veṇṭaḷai 8"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"நீகண்","tr":"nīkaṇ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நீ","tr":"nī"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"}]},{"text":"டனையோ","tr":"ṭaṉaiyō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டனை","tr":"ṭaṉai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யோ","tr":"yō"}]},{"text":"கண்டார்க்","tr":"kaṇṭārk","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டார்க்","tr":"ṭārk"}]},{"text":"கேட்டனையோ","tr":"kēṭṭaṉaiyō","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கேட்","tr":"kēṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டனை","tr":"ṭaṉai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யோ","tr":"yō"}]}],[{"text":"ஒன்று","tr":"oṉṟu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஒன்","tr":"oṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"தௌய","tr":"tauya","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தௌ","tr":"tau"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"நசையினம்","tr":"nacaiyiṉam","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நசை","tr":"nacai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினம்","tr":"yiṉam"}]},{"text":"மொழிமோ","tr":"moḻimō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மொழி","tr":"moḻi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மோ","tr":"mō"}]}],[{"text":"வெண்கோட்","tr":"veṇkōṭ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெண்","tr":"veṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோட்","tr":"kōṭ"}]},{"text":"டியானை","tr":"ṭiyāṉai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டியா","tr":"ṭiyā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னை","tr":"ṉai"}]},{"text":"சோணை","tr":"cōṇai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சோ","tr":"cō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணை","tr":"ṇai"}]},{"text":"படியும்","tr":"paṭiyum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"படி","tr":"paṭi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]}],[{"text":"பொன்மலி","tr":"poṉmali","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பொன்","tr":"poṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மலி","tr":"mali"}]},{"text":"பாடலி","tr":"pāṭali","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டலி","tr":"ṭali"}]},{"text":"பெறீஇயர்","tr":"peṟīiyar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெறீ","tr":"peṟī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"இயர்","tr":"iyar"}]}],[{"text":"யார்வாய்க்","tr":"yārvāyk","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யார்","tr":"yār"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாய்க்","tr":"vāyk"}]},{"text":"கேட்டனை","tr":"kēṭṭaṉai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கேட்","tr":"kēṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டனை","tr":"ṭaṉai"}]},{"text":"காதலர்","tr":"kātalar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலர்","tr":"talar"}]},{"text":"வரவே","tr":"varavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வர","tr":"vara"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"நீகண்","parts":[{"text":"நீகண்","lemma":"நீகண்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டனையோ","parts":[{"text":"டனையோ","lemma":"டனையோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கண்டார்க்","parts":[{"text":"கண்டார்க்","lemma":"கண்டார்க்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கேட்டனையோ","parts":[{"text":"கேட்டனையோ","lemma":"கேட்டனையோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒன்று","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்று","lemma":"ஒன்று","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தௌிய","parts":[{"text":"தௌிய","lemma":"தௌிய","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நசையினம்","parts":[{"text":"நசையினம்","lemma":"நசையினம்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மொழிமோ","parts":[{"text":"மொழிமோ","lemma":"மொழிமோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"வெண்கோட்","parts":[{"text":"வெண்கோட்","lemma":"வெண்கோட்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டியானை","parts":[{"text":"டியானை","lemma":"டியானை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சோணை","parts":[{"text":"சோணை","lemma":"சோணை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"படியும்","parts":[{"text":"படியும்","lemma":"படியும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"பொன்","parts":[{"text":"பொன்","lemma":"பொன்","gloss":"gold"}],"gloss":"gold"},{"surface":"மலி","parts":[{"text":"மலி","lemma":"மலி","gloss":"abound"}],"gloss":"abounding in"},{"surface":"பாடலி","parts":[{"text":"பாடலி","lemma":"பாடலி","gloss":"Pataliputra city"}],"gloss":"Pataliputra city"},{"surface":"பெறீஇயர்","parts":[{"text":"பெறீஇயர்","lemma":"பெறீஇயர்","gloss":"may you obtain"}],"gloss":"may you obtain","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யார்","parts":[{"text":"யார்","lemma":"யார்","gloss":"who"}],"gloss":"whose"},{"surface":"வாய்க்","parts":[{"text":"வாய்க்","lemma":"வாய்க்","gloss":"from the mouth of"}],"gloss":"from the mouth of","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கேட்டனை","parts":[{"text":"கேள்","lemma":"கேள்","gloss":"hear"},{"text":"ட்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அனை","lemma":"அனை","gloss":"second person singular suffix"}],"gloss":"you heard"},{"surface":"காதலர்","parts":[{"text":"காதல்","lemma":"காதல்","gloss":"love"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"honorific/plural suffix"}],"gloss":"lover"},{"surface":"வரவே","parts":[{"text":"வரவு","lemma":"வரவு","gloss":"coming"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis marker"}],"gloss":"the coming indeed"}]}],"literal":"Did you see yourself? Or did you hear from those who saw? / Speak one thing clearly, as we desire to know! / Where white-tusked elephants bathe in the Sone river, / may you obtain gold-abounding Pataliputra! / From whose mouth did you hear of the coming of my lover?","translation":"Did you see him yourself, or did you hear from those who saw him? Speak clearly so that we, who long for him, may know the truth. May you obtain the gold-abounding city of Pataliputra, where white-tusked elephants bathe in the Sone river! From whose mouth did you hear the news of my lover's return?","modern":"நீயே அவரைப் பார்த்தாயா? அல்லது பார்த்தவர்களிடம் கேட்டாயா? நாங்கள் தெளிவுபெற விரும்புகிறோம், உண்மையைச் சொல்! வெண்மையான தந்தங்களை உடைய யானைகள் சோணை நதியில் நீராடும், பொன் நிறைந்த பாடலிபுத்திர நகரத்தையே நீ பரிசாகப் பெறுவாயாக! என் காதலர் வருவதைப் பற்றிய செய்தியை நீ யாருடைய வாயிலாகக் கேட்டாய்?","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her friend or a messenger who has brought the news of her lover's return. Filled with immense joy and disbelief, she wants to confirm if the news is absolutely true. She asks whether the informant saw him personally or heard it from others who did. In her gratitude and excitement, she blesses the informant to receive a reward as grand as the wealthy city of Pataliputra, where elephants bathe in the Sone river. This historical allusion to the wealth of Pataliputra highlights the immense value she places on the news of her lover's return.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}